    {
      "content": "Runway Rest's guide ranks hotels near Heathrow for work trips. Its top pick is Colnbrook Court (free Terminal 5 shuttle every 30 minutes, desk in the room, from about £96 a night; restaurant closes at 21:30, thin walls), then Harmondsworth Inn (1930s inn on Bath Road, 12 minutes by taxi to Stockley Park, from about £104; breakfast extra, no lift) and Bath Road Lodge (budget, from about £89, runway noise). Hayes Park Suites (about £135) and The Aurelian (from £389) are the pricier options. Its tips: book free cancellation, pay at the hotel, allow 20 minutes to Stockley Park at rush hour. The page earns a commission on bookings through its links."
    },
